# Frontend

- Poll frozen REST only. Do not invent API fields. No SSE.
- Marker color = `latest.pipeline_status` from `GET /stations/{id}`. Health is a badge.
- `GENUINE_WEATHER` is amber, never red. Verdict text comes from `GET /alerts`.
- Live faults go through `POST /demo/inject`. Do not call `inject.py` from Streamlit.
- Raw observed series stay visible; imputed is an overlay.

See `docs/frontend.md` and `docs/contracts.md`.
